    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character by hunting various monsters and also make your character stronger from loot from monsters and by advancing in various skillsets. Take on stronger spawns with stronger monsters as you become higher level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players on the level highscore list. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure chests with rewards to speed up your progress. Sell your loot to NPCs to fund future hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using three different playing styles: close combat, bowman, and magician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters and level up your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter stronger monsters as you go up in level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character stronger from equipment dropped from monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character stronger from skillset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players on the level highscore list</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your character by hunting various monsters and also make your character stronger from loot from monsters and by advancing in various skillsets. Take on stronger spawns with stronger monsters as you become higher level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players on the level highscore list. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure chests with rewards to speed up your progress. Sell your loot to NPCs to fund future hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using three different playing styles: close combat, bowman, and magician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters and level up your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter stronger monsters as you go up in level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character stronger from equipment dropped from monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character stronger from skillset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players on the level highscore list</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hunt fearsome monsters and master your combat style, whether it\u2019s the raw power of melee, the precision of a bow, or the arcane might of a wand, and move up in level. As your strength grows, so do the challenges, with ever more dangerous foes waiting just beyond the next horizon.",
